Welcome to NetBSD on the Espressif ESP32-S31!

  RV32IMAFC + Sv32 MMU, 16 MiB PSRAM.  The root file system is read-only,
  straight from SPI flash.  /etc and /persist are kept in a 1 MB flash
  partition (rc.local, espwifi.conf, ...); /tmp, /var and /root are in
  memory.  USB sticks: mount -t msdos /dev/sd0e /mnt
